# Case portrait ban list (mandatory)

**Canonical:** `dev/case-portraits/BANNED.md` + `server/bannedCasePortraits.js`

## Regeneration is MANUAL ONLY (do not break this)

Portraits regenerate **only** on an explicit `refresh: true` (the Regenerate Portrait
button — `RegeneratePatientButton.jsx` / `CasePortraitBriefPanel.jsx`). Case **load must
never auto-regenerate** — not on sex / uber / frame-version / layer-version drift, and
**not on a ban**. Regenerating on load = the ~90s "regenerates every time" bug Steve hit.

- Server load path (`/api/regenerate-patient-from-case` with `refresh:false`, and
  `GET /api/case-portrait/:caseId`) calls `readPortraitCache(dir, id, { allowBanned: true })`
  and returns the cached portrait whenever the PNG exists.
- Client `regeneratePatientFromCase` (`src/lib/patientRegen.js`) reuses any existing
  cached portrait on load; staleness checks must **not** clear + re-request.
- `refresh: true` skips the cache entirely and rebuilds (optionally with a character ref).
- **Not-yet-generated case (no cache) → default sex-aware plate.** `ensureCasePortrait`
  (`src/lib/patientRegen.js`) returns `getBuiltInPatientSrc(caseData)` (male / female /
  pediatric) on load when there is no cached portrait — it does **not** generate. The
  first real portrait is built only when the user presses Regenerate.

## What the ban still means

`isCasePortraitBanned(caseId)` = **never reuse as a generation reference and never
ship/screenshot as canonical**. It no longer forces a load-time regen. To actually
replace a banned plate, Steve presses Regenerate (or runs
`node scripts/purge-banned-case-portraits.mjs` after editing the ban list).

## Never ship these failure modes

- Robotic / stock / photoreal headswap — not MeWorld sculptural CGI
- Distorted faces or destroyed IV layers
- ECG electrodes **on clothing** — bare chest / gown open (`CLINICAL_ACCURACY_RULES.md`)
- Same generated face copied across unrelated case IDs without uber lock

## Uber / catalog cases

Regen **only** from shipped `*-GAME-SCENE.png` + `CHARACTER-MAP` — not generic `patient-scene-female.png` Magnific edit.

## `*_mask.png` is not an O₂ mask

Internal alpha for IV layer compositing (`deriveIvMaskFromDiff`). Delete with base/iv when banning.
